<title>USA: Abraxas begins $200 mln private placement.</title>
<headline>Abraxas begins $200 mln private placement.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abraxas Petroleum Corp said Monday that it has started a $200 million private placement of senior notes due 2004.</p>
<p>The net proceeds of the placement will be used to repay outstanding amounts under a credit facility with Bankers Trust Co and ING Capital Corp and to complete the previously announced acquisitions of GGS Canadian Gas Gathering Systems Inc and two fields in Texas, the company said.</p>
<p>The company said it expects closing in November.</p>
</text>
